        "created_at": "2013-04-12T22:20:11.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Ideally, I would now synthesize this thread into a clear question or set of questions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But my brain is tired.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Someone want to do that for me? I want to make sure that the result includes the discussion from the previous thread that dypaca &nbsp;had pointed out.</p>",
