        "created_at": "2013-07-12T00:48:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Answered in the KantCon rullings (<span>https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/answers-to-debated-questions-3871)</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>3. Using Hypersonic Assault on Matriarch first then the fowls, would that stop Matriarch from dealing damage from the destruction of fowls?</strong></p><p>Yes, the second line is meant to modify the damage, not an order of actions.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>4. Using Hypersonic Assault, Throat Jab, Offensive Transmutation, ect. on Sonic Mine, does that prevent it from dealing damage?</strong></p><p>It does, as with the case of question 3.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
